imsd (1.1.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging, built with the Debian toolchain (clang/libc++ 22,
    CMake) instead of Crafter.Build.
  * d/patches/0001: CMake build.
  * d/patches/0002: try P-CSCFs that did not answer last.
  * d/patches/0003: optional PipeWire target and channel for call audio.
  * d/patches/0004: stop the pw-* helpers with SIGTERM before SIGKILL, so the
    microphone is released after a call.
  * imsd-plasma: no file in /etc/skel; README.Debian has the per-user step.

